NAME: a while with EQ
DESCRIPTION: (while (EQ x 0) (ADD 1 x)) runs once from x = 0 and leaves with x = 1; see behtests/while_eq.beh
SRC:
(let (x 0)
  (seq
    (while (EQ x 0) (ADD 1 x))
    (JMP 0)
    (DAT 0 (store x))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

_WHI4 
  SEQ.B  $_LET1 , #0     
  JMP    $_WHF4 , #0     
  ADD.AB #1     , $_LET1 
  JMP    $_WHI4 , #0     
_WHF4 
  JMP    #0     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     